pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Radio switch-back oracle (docs/specs/RADIO.md, SPEC-RADIO) on acc9-stock,
# parked at idle, starting with the radio off. D-pad right (0008) and left
# (0004) switch to Bass Arena and away and back after 10, 20 and 40 s,
# then between Bass Arena and Pulse, inside three 60 s audiocaptures, so
# tools/re/radio.py match shows whether a station resumes, restarts or
# moves on. Dense HUD captures after the first press time the popup.
# Run hidden with PINYON_SHIFT_AUDIO_PROBE_SECONDS=60 and the other mix
# categories at 0, as fh1-radio-cycle.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 900 3000 vehicle
audiocapture 1000
input 1200 0008 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1206 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1220 r1-020
capture 1230 r1-030
capture 1236 r1-036
capture 1242 r1-042
capture 1248 r1-048
capture 1254 r1-054
capture 1266 r1-066
capture 1278 r1-078
capture 1320 r1-120
capture 1350 r1-150
capture 1370 r1-170
capture 1380 r1-180
capture 1390 r1-190
capture 1400 r1-200
capture 1410 r1-210
capture 1420 r1-220
capture 1430 r1-230
input 2400 0004 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2406 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2436 off-036
capture 2448 off-048
capture 2580 off-180
capture 2600 off-200
capture 2620 off-220
input 3000 0008 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 3006 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 3600 0004 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 3606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
audiocapture 4700
input 4800 0008 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 4806 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 6000 0008 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 6006 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 7200 0004 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 7206 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
audiocapture 8400
input 8460 0004 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 8466 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 10860 0008 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 10866 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 12000 end
stop 12400
